      "type": "text",
      "id": "n",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 686.4000000000001,
      "height": 60,
      "text": "Each stage is a Go function that hands each element to the next. Nothing runs\nuntil first asks. A stop is recognised only by the consumer that made it, so a\ntake inside a pipeline ends its own source and not the pipeline around it.",
      "originalText": "Each stage is a Go function that hands each element to the next. Nothing runs\nuntil first asks. A stop is recognised only by the consumer that made it, so a\ntake inside a pipeline ends its own source and not the pipeline around it.",
